Subject: [PATCH 13/18] tests: v1d - 0x142/0x10A/0x68 vs run 5, KL15/NM unit
 checks, replay KL15/NM model, dyn-run3 and dyn-mitm

- core: minislot formula table, CTR8 counter, 0x142 phases, KL15/NM state machine incl. ceiling
- replay: PIO FIFO depth / top-up model, 0xF1 fed to dde_emu_on_frame, independent KL15/NM
  model of the vehicle frames, 0x5C checks (cycle, slot, NM window, vs the real DDE),
  KL15-gated PDU checks, 0x142 phase checks, v4 stats print
- extract_replay.py: v1d IDs removed / written to --dde-out, 0xF1 b3 column
- savvy_to_replay.py: SavvyCAN MITM CSV -> replay vectors (dyn-mitm)
- dyn-unsure: unknown-length injection now 18 bytes (20 is known: 7 minislots)
